## Usage

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const enabled = ref(true)
  </script>

  <template>
    <TuffSwitch v-model="enabled" />
  </template>
---
:::

### Toggle State
Click, Enter, or Space toggles the switch.
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="SwitchToggleStateDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TuffSwitch v-model="first" />
    <TuffSwitch v-model="second" />
  </template>
---
:::

### Sizes
`size` also sets the label's font size and gap.
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="SwitchSizesDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TuffSwitch v-model="enabled" label="Small" size="small" />
    <TuffSwitch v-model="enabled" label="Default" />
    <TuffSwitch v-model="enabled" label="Large" size="large" />
  </template>
---
:::

